    { "a": "Weighted cross-entropy", "t": "indist", "aka": ["class-weighted cross-entropy", "balanced cross-entropy", "weighted BCE", "cost-sensitive cross-entropy", "cost-sensitive loss"], "q": "Cross-entropy with a weight per class, so rare classes count for more." },
